# Google OAuth client config — not a secret for a native PKCE app, but kept local by choice.
# To build Google Sign-In yourself: Google Cloud Console → create an iOS OAuth client → drop the
# downloaded plist into Goals/ (see comment in Goals/Auth/GoogleAuthConfiguration.swift).
